title: ie4uinit Command Execution via INF
id: a682b676-ae2e-4150-899d-f9502f255e23
status: experimental
description: Detects ie4uinit.exe run with -BaseSettings or a crafted ie4uinit.inf in a user-writable path, an obscure LOLBin technique to execute commands referenced from the INF.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\ie4uinit.exe'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - '-BaseSettings'
      - '-UserConfig'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - None expected
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1218
